      "post_id": "2085832001706151978",
      "url": "https://x.com/kenkenlewu/status/2085832001706151978",
      "text": "Temu is the best for shopping if you can master the details of online shopping....\n\nThis is the fourth time I'm ordering goods worth over ₦200k on Temu in the space of three months, and with each order, I make nothing less than ₦70k in profit.\n\nI just made this order on the 1st of this month, still in transit. \n\nIt is just a random business I started with a woman in my church, and it has been going well.\n\nTemu is not about seeing things and then clicking \"Buy.\" Reading and understanding product details are very crucial.",
      "original_text": "Temu is the best for shopping if you can master the details of online shopping....\n\nThis is the fourth time I'm ordering goods worth over ₦200k on Temu in the space of three months, and with each order, I make nothing less than ₦70k in profit.\n\nI just made this order on the 1st of this month, still in transit. \n\nIt is just a random business I started with a woman in my church, and it has been going well.\n\nTemu is not about seeing things and then clicking \"Buy.\" Reading and understanding product details are very crucial.",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "如果你能掌握网购的细节，Temu 是最适合购物的平台……\n\n这是我三个月内第四次在 Temu 上订购价值超过 ₦200k 的商品，而且每一单我都能赚不少于 ₦70k 的利润。\n\n我是在这个月 1 号刚下的这单，还在运输途中。\n\n这只是我和教堂里一位女士偶然开始的一门小生意，而且一直进展得很好。\n\nTemu 不是看到东西然后点击“购买”那么简单。阅读并理解产品详情非常关键。",
